Description: pvr: advertise 8-bit and 16-bit storage and shaderInt8
 Enable storageBuffer16BitAccess, uniformAndStorageBuffer16BitAccess,
 storagePushConstant16, storageBuffer8BitAccess,
 uniformAndStorageBuffer8BitAccess, storagePushConstant8 and shaderInt8,
 based on the lowering of the previous patch ("pco: lower 8-bit and 16-bit
 integers and memory accesses to 32 bit"). storageInputOutput16 stays
 disabled: 16-bit varyings are not handled (pvr_arch_pipeline.c asserts on
 16-bit outputs). The extension names VK_KHR_8bit_storage,
 VK_KHR_16bit_storage and VK_KHR_shader_float16_int8 are not advertised;
 the features are core in Vulkan 1.2, and zink switches to compute based
 texture transfers once all three names are present.
 .
 Only for this downstream stack; not intended for upstream submission.
